 "type": "lib",
 "name": "netsurf-core",
 "description": "NetSurf browser core (content/fetchers-minus-curl, css/html/text/image handlers, desktop, utils) + gucOS shims. PARTIAL component: consumers must also dep the constellation libs, and MUST list this json as their FIRST dep so the core include dirs precede the lib dirs (see README.md).",
